  "details": "After exiting from desktop mode and launching into VR mode of the same instance, I was soft-locked in a loading screen for two minutes while observing a black VRChat window in desktop mode and \"Connecting...\" in SteamVR and then sent to a newly created Friends instance after failing to enter room in time.\n\n1. Joined a friend in a Friends+ in desktop mode for ~31 minutes. (03:58:48 - 04:31:51)\n\n2. The only friend in the instance left. (04:20:30)\n\n3. I grabbed the launch URL for this instance from VRChat Home and exited VRChat.\n\n4. I launched into VR mode with SteamVR using a launch link to Friends+: <https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_364b12a0-6deb-48e3-bd4a-86a3b940592d&instanceId=09174~hidden(usr_1e69bd21-037c-4bcc-8036-4aeccd3ca231)~region(use)>. (04:32:00)\n\n5. Soft-locked in \"Connecting...\" in VR / black screen in desktop mode window until timeout after 2 minutes. Unable to take a screenshot in SteamVR because the VRChat client was a white window in VR with \"Connecting...\" in the background.\n\n```\n\n2026.05.29 04:32:22 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnRoomPropertiesUpdate\n\n2026.05.29 04:32:22 Debug      -  [Behaviour] Holding recovery payload until all bunches are received.\n\n2026.05.29 04:32:44 Error      -  [Behaviour] Could not refresh room because: Must request travel first․\n\n2026.05.29 04:33:14 Error      -  [Behaviour] Could not refresh room because: Must request travel first․\n\n2026.05.29 04:33:15 Error      -  [Behaviour] Could not refresh room because: Must request travel first․\n\n2026.05.29 04:33:17 Error      -  [Behaviour] Could not refresh room because: Must request travel first․\n\n2026.05.29 04:33:21 Error      -  [Behaviour] Could not refresh room because: Must request travel first․\n\n2026.05.29 04:33:29 Error      -  [Behaviour] Could not refresh room because: Must request travel first․\n\n2026.05.29 04:33:45 Error      -  [Behaviour] Could not refresh room because: Must request travel first․\n\n2026.05.29 04:34:15 Error      -  [Behaviour] Could not enter room in time - waiting for master\n\n```\n\nExpected behavior: Rejoin the instance normally from a launch URL in VR.\n\nActual behavior: Soft-locked for 2 minutes with a black VRChat window, TryAlternateInstance sent me to my own alternative Friends instance instead of the instance (Friends+) I wanted to join.\n\nNot a recurring issue, yet. Unknown if this is reproducible.",
